flowchart LR
  request[User request]
  index[index.md compact rules]
  intake[harness/intake.md]
  source{Source of truth?}
  concept[Concept phase\nwiki/concepts/ or wiki/projects/]
  prerepo[Pre-repo project\nwiki/projects/<project>/]
  repo[Real repo work\nactive repo docs and code]
  lookup{Knowledge Lookup Metric}
  harness[Harness + templates]
  knowledge[Knowledge guides]
  work[Task, output, or answer]
  proof[Validation report or result report]
  checkpoint[Checkpoint in the correct place]

  request --> index --> intake --> source
  source --> concept
  source --> prerepo
  source --> repo
  repo --> lookup
  lookup -->|0-2 skip| work
  lookup -->|3 optional| knowledge
  lookup -->|4-6 consult| knowledge
  lookup -->|7-10 consult + ask Codex| knowledge
  concept --> harness
  prerepo --> harness
  harness --> work
  knowledge --> work
  work --> proof --> checkpoint

  classDef start fill:#f7f7f2,stroke:#4b5563,color:#111827
  classDef decision fill:#fff4cc,stroke:#8a6d1d,color:#111827
  classDef repo fill:#e8f3ff,stroke:#2463a6,color:#111827
  classDef knowledge fill:#e9f7ef,stroke:#2f7d4a,color:#111827
  classDef proof fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#7e3fb2,color:#111827

  class request,index,intake start
  class source,lookup decision
  class repo,concept,prerepo repo
  class harness,knowledge knowledge
  class work,proof,checkpoint proof
